            <description><![CDATA[
### Fixed

- App failed to launch from `/Applications` because the bundled
  `Sparkle.framework` was not on dyld's search path. The release script now
  injects `@executable_path/../Frameworks` into the main executable's rpath
  before codesigning.
]]></description>
